  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/08/AbertoRodenasToroSanJoaquin1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 376px;\" /></p>\n<p>49 fotos del primer d&iacute;a de toros en las fiestas de la calle San Joaqu&iacute;n de Onda, este lunes, con ganado de La Espuela y la prueba del toro de la ganader&iacute;a de Andr&eacute;s Moreno, perteneciente tambi&eacute;n a La Espuela, como las vaquillas del martes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8402.jpg\" alt=\"img_8402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8403.jpg\" alt=\"img_8403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8404.jpg\" alt=\"img_8404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8405.jpg\" alt=\"img_8405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8406.jpg\" alt=\"img_8406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8407.jpg\" alt=\"img_8407\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8409.jpg\" alt=\"img_8409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8410.jpg\" alt=\"img_8410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dillunsfestessantjoaquim15/img_8413.jpg\" alt=\"img_8413\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:au